 "about": "P-164 (fix-g0-box, lead option a): g-fastshort-v1 (PR-018 rev 7) for g0 builds. The same strokes, marks and profiles; g0 pins the opened page at the y where its touch jack fired and opening grows docH, so atEnd never holds there: every `until atEnd` is optional with a 1500 ms timeout and followed by `until y>=3000` (the pull-to-refresh guard), the approach repeat runs at most 12 passes and each re-approach repeat at most 2. A new program: its numbers do not compare with P-161/P-163 (v1).",
